| OriginalAirDate = {{Start date|2020|7|15}}
| Viewers         = 1.38<ref name="708Ratings">{{Cite web |last=Metcalf |first=Mitch |date=July 16, 2020 |title=Updated: ShowBuzzDaily's Top 150 Wednesday Cable Originals & Network Finals: 7.15.2020 |url=http://www.showbuzzdaily.com/articles/showbuzzdailys-top-150-wednesday-cable-originals-network-finals-7-15-2020.html |url-status=dead |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20200716204659/http://www.showbuzzdaily.com/articles/showbuzzdailys-top-150-wednesday-cable-originals-network-finals-7-15-2020.html |archive-date=July 16, 2020 |access-date=July 16, 2020 |website=[[Showbuzz Daily]]}}</ref>
| ShortSummary    = After rescuing Mack, Deke, and Coulson, Simmons informs the team that the time drive keeps jumping them forward by less time until it will eventually collapse on them. Needing Yo-Yo's currently inactive powers to deactivate it, Daisy suggests stopping by Afterlife to get help from her mother [[Jiaying (Marvel Cinematic Universe)|Jiaying]]. Yo-Yo and May arrive to discover that Jiaying is in the process of helping a despondent [[Inhumans (Marvel Cinematic Universe)|Inhuman]] named [[Kora (Marvel Cinematic Universe)|Kora]] with her volatile energy powers. After examining Yo-Yo, Jiaying comes to the conclusion that her problems are mental rather than physical and has May use her empath abilities on her. Yo-Yo reveals that she witnessed the death of her uncle and has since blamed herself for it. Nathaniel arrives and recruits Kora in taking over Afterlife. Yo-Yo, May, Jiaying, and young Inhuman [[Gordon (Marvel Cinematic Universe)|Gordon]] are forced to flee. Upon arriving back at the ''Zephyr'', Yo-Yo realizes that she has been holding herself back and successfully deactivates the time drive. As the crew settles in, the time drive suddenly starts up, causing the ''Zephyr'' to unexpectedly jump again.
| LineColor       = 73CDE2
}}
{{Episode list/sublist|Agents of S.H.I.E.L.D. season 7
| EpisodeNumber   = 132
| EpisodeNumber2  = 9
| Title           = [[As I Have Always Been]]
| DirectedBy      = [[Elizabeth Henstridge]]
